# Adaptive Planning

Turn a requirement into a confirmed, portable planning package without
starting implementation.

Read and follow these canonical references in order:

1. [Workflow](references/workflow.md) for the interaction, authorization,
   review, and delivery gates.
2. [Routing](references/routing.md) to choose or revise the route.
3. [Interview and confirmation](references/interview-and-confirmation.md) when
   decisions remain open and before generating documents.
4. [Document formats](references/document-formats.md) for the confirmed route.

Follow applicable local instructions before an explicitly requested repository
write. Use independent review when the runtime provides delegation and it is
appropriate and authorized. Otherwise perform and disclose the structured
self-review defined by the workflow.
